        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage D-ORB Orbit Grade 1 Commercial Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Orbit classic round ball knob is designed for commercial, institutional, and industrial use in facilities such as schools, hospitals, and factories where a long life of dependable operation must be combined with a high degree of resistance to physical abuse. While the 2-3/4\" backset comes standard, 2-3/8\", 3-3/4\", and 5\" backset latches are also available. Good for door thickness from 1-3/8\" up to 2\". A grade 1 lock, this Schlage made knobset is UL listed for 3 hour fire doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Orbit Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets BHMA standards at 3,000,000 cycles</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2, 1996, Series 4000 Grade 1.</li>\r\n<li>UL fire rated for 3 hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed 6-pin  C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Comes Packaged with two keys per lock.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Commercial Orbit Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" (60 mm), 2-3/4\" (70 mm), 3-3/4\" (95 mm) and 5\" (127 mm) backset latches available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock (ANSI F109):</b> Pushing and turning the button on the inside knob locks outside knob. The use of key to enter from the outside is required until button is manually unlocked. On the other hand, just pushing the button on the inside knob and not turning it, locks the outside knob until it is unlocked by a key from the exterior or by turning the inside knob. Inside knob is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom Lock (ANSI F84):</b> Outside knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside knob is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (ANSI F86):</b> The outside knob is fixed. Entrance from the outside is done only by the use of a key. The inside knob is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Orbit Grade 1 Commercial Keyed Door Knob, Schlage D-ORB",
                "description": "Schlage D-Series Orbit Commercial Door Knobs D-ORB - The Orbit classic round ball knob is designed for commercial, institutional, and industrial use in facilities such as schools, hospitals, and factories where a long life of dependable operation must be combined with a high degree of resistance to physical abuse. While the 2-3/4 inch backset comes standard, 2-3/8 inch, 3-3/4 inch, and 5 inch backset latches are also available. Good for door thickness from 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches. A grade 1 lock, this Schlage made knobset is UL listed for 3 hour fire doors.",
                "keywords": "Schlage orbit knobs, schlage D-Series, D-Locks, Schlage orbit commercial knobs, orbit Commercial Knob Locks, schlage heavy duty knobs, SCH-D-orb, ul fired rated door knobs, grade 1 door hardware, orbit schlage knobs,  schlage d orb, schlage ball knobs, Orbit Commercial Keyed Knob"
